{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema\": \"aos-material-review/v1\", \"request_id\": \"qyh-price-api-controller-r1-20261015\", \"task_id\": \"qyh-restoration-readonly-continuation-r5-20261015\", \"owner\": \"codex-01a13484-f019-7d82-94ce-812396db9124\", \"kind\": \"route\", \"baseline\": {\"head\": \"246d8305332c143bd281cc6aedb013649b81f7d6\", \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-002032\", \"files\": {\".evidence/qyh-restoration-readonly-continuation-r5-20261015/api-controller-review-package-r1.txt\": \"3d78e77c5519f2c72a0f37777e55c4b41f096f9ec40aaf8a7e1c7e9963430fdc\"}}, \"claims\": [\"更新控制器核对精确版本与原运行身份后只更新 API\", \"新意图和只读启动门保留且不替代完整重启与经营验收\"], \"materials\": {\".evidence/qyh-restoration-readonly-continuation-r5-20261015/api-controller-review-package-r1.txt\": \"PRE-EFFECT CONTROLLER QUALITY REVIEW. No signal or launch has happened; review explicit fresh guarded API-only control code and actual preflight facts. This is not post-deployment/native SDK acceptance. FullGoal retained; daily fullPG/API/Web remains separate and mandatory on daily/every aos.\\nCONTROLLER_SHA af2a4e581f34e286aaab69496f7381e9e6d1efd345768d22fcd8f1b2cb5d6326\\n\\nFILE .evidence/qyh-restoration-readonly-continuation-r5-20261015/price-contribution-api-plan.md SHA 499460b96f18f18c44ecb7a3e03e896f34eb3cba8433c9a55c68df3862a2a828\\n# 价格贡献候选最新 API 只读维护方案\\n\\n完整231Goal与原唯一真人安装/全恢复授权保留，Authority2032、maintenance-r5同owner范围，原API72678/source53，Web76677/source1627，原PG CID84989681/卷aos-qyh-history159-prepared-data-20261011、StartedAt2026-10-14T20:36:36.408087963Z/schema161/650/绑定0。这里只准备本读取波API更新，不冒充新的daily/aos全面重启；每日与每次aos仍最新提交m1同原卷PG→API→Web，aos2不重启。\\n\\n先完成价格root和reader独立code合法消费、冻结224累计、真实隔离原w6_005 PG并发/RLS/write25006/SQLCASE/privacy后精确提交。通过既有freeze_current_api入口冻结实际最新HEAD、排除dirty/凭据，完整source manifest和四文件SHA对账。当前真实系统尚未部署候选，不提前写实际运行版本。\\n\\n新控制器仅fresh一次API更新：复核exactHEAD/m1/Authority2032/有效sameowner Lease、代码消费及manifest、readonly wrapper/sourceguard/HostworkerProviderOFF、旧API准确PID/cwd/command/18080、WebPID/cwd/18434及frontend树相等、PG准确CID/卷/StartedAt。全650只读before指纹和runtime ACL/schema161/安装ACTIVE5/绑定0先验；不迁移、不改角色/预算/业务、不重放旧维护。\\n\\n独立维护controller质量合法消费后fsync新意图，才给已确认旧API一次SIGTERM；端口free后用原私有身份文件/原OIDC/原安装/bundles/trust与最新冻源启动management readonly。spawn不作监听证明，必须重新核实际PID/cwd/listener/sourcehash；任何已有intent/异常只读对账，不重跑控制器或反复signal。\\n\\n随后原真人正常OIDC/me tenant验证及原正式SDK读取价格贡献、菜单SPA导航、query400/anonymous401/其他price/customer辅助读未借放行；可信空保留null/blocker与commands[]，不prepare/freeze或制造非空经营事实。原650after同cutoff逐表一致、PG/Web/Chrome未signal、端口及reader source均准确。适用1280/1440/1920实际截图对原稿，原Page辅助失败fake0语义、价格高按钮及达人裁切P1如实记录，不以读取200或图可見代替视觉/经营完成。\\n\\n独立现场Prime复审后才精确双sliceDelivery/完整剩余maintenance接续/Authority七强Prime，下一辅助GET逐条登记。完整fullC最终真预算/原部署、自然CaseRun建议exact评审内容受约束能力产物人审续跑总控Wiki、安装全生命周期/八场景/观察发布均待；source/oldunknown12/Schedule/Provider/noPush禁界不变。\\n\\n\\nFILE .evidence/qyh-restoration-readonly-continuation-r5-20261015/price_contribution_api_switch.py SHA af2a4e581f34e286aaab69496f7381e9e6d1efd345768d22fcd8f1b2cb5d6326\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Fresh original-scope API-only readonly switch, no PG/Web/Chrome signal.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport argparse,datetime,hashlib,json,os,signal,subprocess,sys,time\\nE=Path(__file__).resolve().parent;R=E.parents[1];F=R/'.evidence/qyh-full-system-restoration-20261011';HEAD='246d8305332c143bd281cc6aedb013649b81f7d6';OWNER='codex-01a13484-f019-7d82-94ce-812396db9124';OLD=72678;WEB=76677\\nOLD_SOURCE=F/'private/api-source-53d572ba3265d77835a49ee92441c7ce26ea7faa';REPORT=F/'price-contribution-api-20261015.json';CID='84989681fb7d3fc0f42d750672547ca0208fbba08dfef0d93837d8e64245dc3c'\\ndef read(p):return json.loads(p.read_text())\\ndef cmd(*args):return subprocess.check_output(args,cwd=R,text=True,timeout=30).strip()\\ndef save(n,v):\\n with (E/n).open('x') as f:json.dump(v,f,indent=2);f.flush();os.fsync(f.fileno())\\ndef listeners(port):return sorted({int(x) for x in cmd('lsof','-t','-nP',f'-iTCP:{port}','-sTCP:LISTEN').sp